#. module: crm_campaign_vrtl
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:crm_campaign_vrtl.field_utm_campaign__state
msgid ""
" * The 'Draft' status is used during planning.\n"
" * The 'Open' status is used when the campaign are running.\n"
" * The 'Closed' status is when the campaign is over.\n"
" * The 'Cancelled' status is used when the campaign is stopped."
msgstr ""
" * Statusen \"Draft\" används under planeringen.\n"
" * Statusen \"Open\" används när kampanjen pågår.\n"
" * Statusen \"Closed\" används när kampanjen är avslutad.\n"
" * Statusen \"Cancelled\" används när kampanjen stoppas."

